  "description": "This versatile e-mountain bike is fun to ride, based on a lightweight dual suspension frame with 150 mm of travel and 29\" wheels. The plush suspension and large wheel diameters provide a smooth and comfortable ride, even when the terrain gets rough, and give you perfect control over your ride at any moment.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line CX electric drive system offers powerful and long-lasting support, giving you the freedom to explore beyond your usual routes and to push your boundaries. A 12-speed drivetrain will ensure you remain in the optimal pedaling cadence on every leg of your trip. For clean optics and a sleek look, the E-Revox FS also features full cable integration.\n\nThe high-capacity Bosch PowerTube battery integrated into the frame can be removed for remote charging. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: Use the eBike Flow App to control your bike or add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range.",
